<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to inject 2.471 pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to inject 2.471 pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico sought to inject 2.471 billion pesos in the secondary market on Thursday through one single credit auction, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auction was offered as follows:</p>
<p>AMOUNT     TERM</p>
<p>2.471 bln* 1 day</p>
<p>*Amount in pesos</p>
<p>((-- Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9559))</p>
